[{"id":"fm-core1-1.31-q1","number":1,"question":"<p>Sketch the following graphs, identifying where they intersect the coordinate axes and the equations of any asymptotes:</p><ol class=\"parts\" start=\"1\"><li><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y=\\sinh x\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></li><li><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y=\\cosh x\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></li><li><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y=\\tanh x\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></li></ol>","steps":["<h3 class=\"part-label\">a)</h3><figure class=\"diagram\"><img src=\"assets/1.31/solutions/assets/diagrams/131-sol-1a.png\" alt=\"Original mathematical diagram\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">b)</h3><figure class=\"diagram\"><img src=\"assets/1.31/solutions/assets/diagrams/131-sol-1b.png\" alt=\"Original mathematical diagram\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">c)</h3><figure class=\"diagram\"><img src=\"assets/1.31/solutions/assets/diagrams/131-sol-1c.png\" alt=\"Original mathematical diagram\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"]},{"id":"fm-core1-1.31-q2","number":2,"question":"<p>Sketch the following pairs of graphs on the same axes. Label each graph clearly and show where they intersect the coordinate axes:</p><ol class=\"parts\" start=\"1\"><li><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y=\\sinh x\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y=2\\sinh x\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></li><li><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y=\\sinh x\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y=\\sinh(x+3)\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></li><li><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y=\\sinh x\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y=-\\sinh x\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></li><li><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y=\\cosh x\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y=\\cosh x+1\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></li><li><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y=\\cosh x\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y=\\cosh2x\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></li><li><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y=\\cosh x\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y=-\\cosh x\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></li></ol>","steps":["<h3 class=\"part-label\">a)</h3><figure class=\"diagram\"><img src=\"assets/1.31/solutions/assets/diagrams/131-sol-2a.png\" alt=\"Original mathematical diagram\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">b)</h3><figure class=\"diagram\"><img src=\"assets/1.31/solutions/assets/diagrams/131-sol-2b.png\" alt=\"Original mathematical diagram\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">c)</h3><figure class=\"diagram\"><img src=\"assets/1.31/solutions/assets/diagrams/131-sol-2c.png\" alt=\"Original mathematical diagram\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">d)</h3><figure class=\"diagram\"><img src=\"assets/1.31/solutions/assets/diagrams/131-sol-2d.png\" alt=\"Original mathematical diagram\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">e)</h3><figure class=\"diagram\"><img src=\"assets/1.31/solutions/assets/diagrams/131-sol-2e.png\" alt=\"Original mathematical diagram\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">f)</h3><figure class=\"diagram\"><img src=\"assets/1.31/solutions/assets/diagrams/131-sol-2f.png\" alt=\"Original mathematical diagram\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"]},{"id":"fm-core1-1.31-q3","number":3,"question":"<p>By considering the point of inflection (identified on the graphs by a <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\times\" data-display=\"false\"></span>), find the equation of each of the following graphs in the form <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y=\\sinh(x-a)\" data-display=\"false\"></span> or <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y=\\sinh x+b\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, where <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"a\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"b\" data-display=\"false\"></span> are integers:</p><ol class=\"parts\" start=\"1\"><li><figure class=\"diagram\"><img src=\"assets/1.31/questions/assets/diagrams/131-q3a.png\" alt=\"Original mathematical diagram\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></li><li><figure class=\"diagram\"><img src=\"assets/1.31/questions/assets/diagrams/131-q3b.png\" alt=\"Original mathematical diagram\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></li></ol>","steps":["<h3 class=\"part-label\">a)</h3><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y=\\sinh x+b\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>","<p>Substitute <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"(\\ln(\\sqrt2-1),0)\" data-display=\"false\"></span>:</p>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"0=\\sinh(\\ln(\\sqrt2-1))+b\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\Rightarrow0=\\frac{e^{\\ln(\\sqrt2-1)}-e^{-\\ln(\\sqrt2-1)}}2+b\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\Rightarrow0=e^{\\ln(\\sqrt2-1)}-e^{\\ln((\\sqrt2-1)^{-1})}+2b\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\Rightarrow0=\\sqrt2-1-\\frac1{\\sqrt2-1}+2b\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\Rightarrow0=\\sqrt2-1-(1+\\sqrt2)+2b\\Rightarrow0=\\sqrt2-1-1-\\sqrt2+2b\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\Rightarrow2b=2\\Rightarrow b=1\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y=\\sinh x+1\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">b)</h3><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y=\\sinh(x-a)\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>","<p>Substitute <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"(0,\\frac{1-e^4}{2e^2})\" data-display=\"false\"></span>:</p>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\frac{1-e^4}{2e^2}=\\sinh(-a)\\Rightarrow\\frac{1-e^4}{2e^2}=\\frac{e^{-a}-e^{-(-a)}}2\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\Rightarrow\\frac{1-e^4}{e^2}=e^{-a}-e^a\\Rightarrow\\frac1{e^2}-\\frac{e^4}{e^2}=e^{-a}-e^a\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\Rightarrow e^{-2}-e^2=e^{-a}-e^a\\Rightarrow a=2\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y=\\sinh(x-2)\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>"]},{"id":"fm-core1-1.31-q4","number":4,"question":"<p>Find the equation of each of the following graphs in the form <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y=\\cosh(x-a)\" data-display=\"false\"></span> or <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y=\\cosh x+b\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, where <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"a\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"b\" data-display=\"false\"></span> are integers:</p><ol class=\"parts\" start=\"1\"><li><figure class=\"diagram\"><img src=\"assets/1.31/questions/assets/diagrams/131-q4a.png\" alt=\"Original mathematical diagram\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></li><li><figure class=\"diagram\"><img src=\"assets/1.31/questions/assets/diagrams/131-q4b.png\" alt=\"Original mathematical diagram\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></li></ol>","steps":["<h3 class=\"part-label\">a)</h3><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y=\\cosh x+b\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>","<p>Substitute <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"(\\ln(3+2\\sqrt2),0)\" data-display=\"false\"></span>:</p>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"0=\\cosh(\\ln(3+2\\sqrt2))+b\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\Rightarrow0=e^{\\ln(3+2\\sqrt2)}+e^{-\\ln(3+2\\sqrt2)}+2b\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\Rightarrow0=e^{\\ln(3+2\\sqrt2)}+e^{\\ln((3+2\\sqrt2)^{-1})}+2b\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\Rightarrow0=3+2\\sqrt2+\\frac1{3+2\\sqrt2}+2b\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\Rightarrow0=3+2\\sqrt2+3-2\\sqrt2+2b\\Rightarrow0=6+2b\\Rightarrow b=-3\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\therefore y=\\cosh x-3\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">b)</h3><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y=\\cosh(x-a)\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>","<p>Substitute <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"(0,\\frac54)\" data-display=\"false\"></span>:</p>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\frac54=\\cosh(-a)\\Rightarrow\\frac54=\\frac{e^{-a}+e^{-(-a)}}2\\Rightarrow\\frac52=e^{-a}+e^a\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\Rightarrow\\frac52e^a=1+e^{2a}\\Rightarrow0=e^{2a}-\\frac52e^a+1\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\Rightarrow0=2e^{2a}-5e^a+2\\Rightarrow0=(2e^a-1)(e^a-2)\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\Rightarrow e^a=\\frac12\\text{ or }e^a=2\\Rightarrow a=\\ln\\frac12\\text{ or }a=\\ln2\\Rightarrow a=\\pm\\ln2\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\therefore y=\\cosh(x+\\ln2)\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>"]},{"id":"fm-core1-1.31-q5","number":5,"question":"<p>State the equations of the asymptotes of the following graphs:</p><ol class=\"parts\" start=\"1\"><li><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y=\\tanh(x-2)+5\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></li><li><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y=\\tanh(x+\\frac52)-\\frac32\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></li></ol>","steps":["<h3 class=\"part-label\">a)</h3><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y=\\tanh x\" data-display=\"false\"></span> has horizontal asymptotes at <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y=-1\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y=1\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p>","<p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y=\\tanh x\\mapsto y=\\tanh(x-2)+5\" data-display=\"false\"></span> is a translation by the vector <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\begin{pmatrix}2\\\\5\\end{pmatrix}\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, so the horizontal asymptotes are translated 5 units upwards.</p>","<p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\therefore y=\\tanh(x-2)+5\" data-display=\"false\"></span> has horizontal asymptotes at <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y=4\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y=6\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">b)</h3><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y=\\tanh x\" data-display=\"false\"></span> has horizontal asymptotes at <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y=-1\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y=1\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p>","<p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y=\\tanh x\\mapsto y=\\tanh(x+\\frac52)-\\frac32\" data-display=\"false\"></span> is a translation by the vector <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\begin{pmatrix}-\\frac52\\\\-\\frac32\\end{pmatrix}\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, so the horizontal asymptotes are translated <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\frac32\" data-display=\"false\"></span> units downwards.</p>","<p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\therefore y=\\tanh(x+\\frac52)-\\frac32\" data-display=\"false\"></span> has horizontal asymptotes at <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y=-\\frac52\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y=-\\frac12\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p>"]},{"id":"fm-core1-1.31-q6","number":6,"question":"<p>Sketch each of the following graphs, identifying where they intersect the coordinate axes and the equations of any asymptotes:</p><ol class=\"parts\" start=\"1\"><li><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y=\\tanh x+1\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></li><li><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y=\\tanh(x-1)\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></li><li><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y=\\tanh x-2\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></li><li><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y=-\\tanh x\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></li></ol>","steps":["<h3 class=\"part-label\">a)</h3><figure class=\"diagram\"><img src=\"assets/1.31/solutions/assets/diagrams/131-sol-6a.png\" alt=\"Original mathematical diagram\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">b)</h3><figure class=\"diagram\"><img src=\"assets/1.31/solutions/assets/diagrams/131-sol-6b.png\" alt=\"Original mathematical diagram\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">c)</h3><figure class=\"diagram\"><img src=\"assets/1.31/solutions/assets/diagrams/131-sol-6c.png\" alt=\"Original mathematical diagram\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">d)</h3><figure class=\"diagram\"><img src=\"assets/1.31/solutions/assets/diagrams/131-sol-6d.png\" alt=\"Original mathematical diagram\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"]},{"id":"fm-core1-1.31-q7","number":7,"question":"<p>Sketch each of the following graphs, identifying where they intersect the coordinate axes and the equations of any asymptotes:</p><ol class=\"parts\" start=\"1\"><li><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y=3\\tanh x\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></li><li><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y=\\frac12\\tanh x\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></li></ol>","steps":["<h3 class=\"part-label\">a)</h3><figure class=\"diagram\"><img src=\"assets/1.31/solutions/assets/diagrams/131-sol-7a.png\" alt=\"Original mathematical diagram\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">b)</h3><figure class=\"diagram\"><img src=\"assets/1.31/solutions/assets/diagrams/131-sol-7b.png\" alt=\"Original mathematical diagram\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"]},{"id":"fm-core1-1.31-q8","number":8,"question":"<p>Find the equation of each of the following graphs in the form <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y=\\tanh(x-a)\" data-display=\"false\"></span> or <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y=\\tanh x+b\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, where <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"a\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"b\" data-display=\"false\"></span> are integers:</p><ol class=\"parts\" start=\"1\"><li><figure class=\"diagram\"><img src=\"assets/1.31/questions/assets/diagrams/131-q8a.png\" alt=\"Original mathematical diagram\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></li><li><figure class=\"diagram\"><img src=\"assets/1.31/questions/assets/diagrams/131-q8b.png\" alt=\"Original mathematical diagram\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></li><li><figure class=\"diagram\"><img src=\"assets/1.31/questions/assets/diagrams/131-q8c.png\" alt=\"Original mathematical diagram\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></li></ol>","steps":["<h3 class=\"part-label\">a)</h3><span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\frac{3+1}{2}=2\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y=\\tanh x+2\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">b)</h3><span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\frac{\\frac12+(-\\frac32)}2=-\\frac12\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y=\\tanh x-\\frac12\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">c)</h3><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y=\\tanh(x-a)\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>","<p>Substitute <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"(0,\\frac{e^4-1}{e^4+1})\" data-display=\"false\"></span>:</p>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\frac{e^4-1}{e^4+1}=\\tanh(-a)\\Rightarrow\\frac{e^4-1}{e^4+1}=\\frac{e^{-2a}-1}{e^{-2a}+1}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\Rightarrow-2a=4\\Rightarrow a=-2\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\therefore y=\\tanh(x+2)\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>"]},{"id":"fm-core1-1.31-q9","number":9,"question":"<p>It is given that <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"k&gt;1\" data-display=\"false\"></span>. Sketch the following graphs, identifying where they intersect the coordinate axes and the equations of any asymptotes:</p><ol class=\"parts\" start=\"1\"><li><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y=\\sinh(x-k)+k\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></li><li><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y=\\cosh(x+k)-k\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></li><li><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y=\\tanh(x-k)-k\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></li></ol>","steps":["<h3 class=\"part-label\">a)</h3><figure class=\"diagram\"><img src=\"assets/1.31/solutions/assets/diagrams/131-sol-9a.png\" alt=\"Original mathematical diagram\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">b)</h3><figure class=\"diagram\"><img src=\"assets/1.31/solutions/assets/diagrams/131-sol-9b.png\" alt=\"Original mathematical diagram\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">c)</h3><figure class=\"diagram\"><img src=\"assets/1.31/solutions/assets/diagrams/131-sol-9c.png\" alt=\"Original mathematical diagram\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"]},{"id":"fm-core1-1.31-q10","number":10,"question":"<p>Sketch each of the following graphs, identifying where they intersect the coordinate axes and the equations of any asymptotes:</p><ol class=\"parts\" start=\"1\"><li><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y=1-\\sinh x\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></li><li><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y=-\\frac12\\cosh x\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></li><li><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y=2\\tanh x+1\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></li><li><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y=2\\sinh x-1\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></li><li><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y=3\\cosh x-5\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></li><li><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y=2-\\frac12\\tanh x\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></li></ol>","steps":["<h3 class=\"part-label\">a)</h3><figure class=\"diagram\"><img src=\"assets/1.31/solutions/assets/diagrams/131-sol-10a.png\" alt=\"Original mathematical diagram\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">b)</h3><figure class=\"diagram\"><img src=\"assets/1.31/solutions/assets/diagrams/131-sol-10b.png\" alt=\"Original mathematical diagram\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">c)</h3><figure class=\"diagram\"><img src=\"assets/1.31/solutions/assets/diagrams/131-sol-10c.png\" alt=\"Original mathematical diagram\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">d)</h3><figure class=\"diagram\"><img src=\"assets/1.31/solutions/assets/diagrams/131-sol-10d.png\" alt=\"Original mathematical diagram\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">e)</h3><figure class=\"diagram\"><img src=\"assets/1.31/solutions/assets/diagrams/131-sol-10e.png\" alt=\"Original mathematical diagram\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">f)</h3><figure class=\"diagram\"><img src=\"assets/1.31/solutions/assets/diagrams/131-sol-10f.png\" alt=\"Original mathematical diagram\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"]},{"id":"fm-core1-1.31-q11","number":11,"question":"<p>Both of the following hyperbolic curves are transformations of <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y=\\cosh x\" data-display=\"false\"></span>. No horizontal stretches have been performed. For constant <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"k\" data-display=\"false\"></span> where <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"k&gt;1\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, find a suitable equation for each:</p><ol class=\"parts\" start=\"1\"><li><figure class=\"diagram\"><img src=\"assets/1.31/questions/assets/diagrams/131-q11a.png\" alt=\"Original mathematical diagram\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></li><li><figure class=\"diagram\"><img src=\"assets/1.31/questions/assets/diagrams/131-q11b.png\" alt=\"Original mathematical diagram\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></li></ol>","steps":["<h3 class=\"part-label\">a)</h3><p>First consider <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y=\\cosh x\" data-display=\"false\"></span>:</p>","<p>Reflect in the <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"x\" data-display=\"false\"></span>-axis to get <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y=-\\cosh x\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p>","<p>Translate by <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\begin{pmatrix}0\\\\k\\end{pmatrix}\" data-display=\"false\"></span> to get <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y=k-\\cosh x\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p>","<p>Translate by <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\begin{pmatrix}-k\\\\0\\end{pmatrix}\" data-display=\"false\"></span> to get <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y=k-\\cosh(x+k)\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p>","<p>Check the curve pass through <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"(0,k-\\frac{e^k+e^{-k}}2)\" data-display=\"false\"></span>:</p>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"k-\\cosh(0+k)=k-\\cosh k=k-\\frac{e^k+e^{-k}}2\\text{ as required.}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<p>Alternative Method:</p>","<p>Using the <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y\" data-display=\"false\"></span>-intercept: <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"k-\\frac{e^k+e^{-k}}2\\equiv k-\\cosh k\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p>","<p>This must be the value when <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"x=0\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, hence: <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y=k-\\cosh(x+k)\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p>","<p>Check the curve pass through <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"(-k,k-1)\" data-display=\"false\"></span>:</p>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"k-\\cosh(-k+k)=k-\\cosh0=k-1\\text{ as required.}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">b)</h3><p>First consider <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y=\\cosh x\" data-display=\"false\"></span>:</p>","<p>Reflect in the <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"x\" data-display=\"false\"></span>-axis to get <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y=-\\cosh x\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p>","<p>Stretch, parallel to the <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y\" data-display=\"false\"></span>-axis, scale factor <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"k\" data-display=\"false\"></span> to get <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y=-k\\cosh x\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p>","<p>Translate by <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\begin{pmatrix}0\\\\2k\\end{pmatrix}\" data-display=\"false\"></span> to get <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y=2k-k\\cosh x\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p>","<p>Check the curve passes through <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"(\\ln(2+\\sqrt3),0)\" data-display=\"false\"></span>:</p>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"2k-k\\cosh(\\ln(2+\\sqrt3))\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"=2k-k\\times\\frac{e^{\\ln(2+\\sqrt3)}+e^{-\\ln(2+\\sqrt3)}}2\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"=2k-k\\times\\frac{e^{\\ln(2+\\sqrt3)}+e^{\\ln((2+\\sqrt3)^{-1})}}2\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"=2k-\\frac12k(e^{\\ln(2+\\sqrt3)}+e^{\\ln((2+\\sqrt3)^{-1})})\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"=2k-\\frac12k(2+\\sqrt3+\\frac1{2+\\sqrt3})\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"=2k-\\frac12k(2+\\sqrt3+\\frac1{2+\\sqrt3}\\times\\frac{2-\\sqrt3}{2-\\sqrt3})\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"=2k-\\frac12k(2+\\sqrt3+\\frac{2-\\sqrt3}{4-3})\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"=2k-\\frac12k(2+\\sqrt3+2-\\sqrt3)=2k-\\frac12k\\times4=0\\text{ as required.}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>"]},{"id":"fm-core1-1.31-q12","number":12,"question":"<p>It is given that <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"1&lt;k&lt;2\" data-display=\"false\"></span>. Sketch the following graphs, identifying where they intersect the coordinate axes and the equations of any asymptotes:</p><ol class=\"parts\" start=\"1\"><li><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y=\\sinh(kx-2k)\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></li><li><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y=3k-\\cosh(x+k)\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></li><li><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y=4k-k\\tanh(x-k)\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></li></ol>","steps":["<h3 class=\"part-label\">a)</h3><figure class=\"diagram\"><img src=\"assets/1.31/solutions/assets/diagrams/131-sol-12a.png\" alt=\"Original mathematical diagram\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">b)</h3><figure class=\"diagram\"><img src=\"assets/1.31/solutions/assets/diagrams/131-sol-12b.png\" alt=\"Original mathematical diagram\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">c)</h3><figure class=\"diagram\"><img src=\"assets/1.31/solutions/assets/diagrams/131-sol-12c.png\" alt=\"Original mathematical diagram\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"]}]